    "actual_native": "13actual native cases in6groups: both teams and active/reserve slots, actual291species initialization, lethal overkill/resurrection, second lethal hit/exactly-once death, native trigger10recipient, failed kill, nonexpired aura retention during immediate revival and native cleanup, native242one-round processing/repeated lethal immunity/owner-only expiry/restored states/repeated expiry, fullProceedRound with the slower revived pet executing its queued native Bite, invalid internal contexts. No character/login/save; actual linked game functions, no gameplay endpoint mocks.",
    "controls": "Five expected-failing controls compile the complete original PetBattle.cpp and PetBattleAbilityEffect.cpp from1768a2717 into the actual native probe, using matching current headers. The added execution-state bool occupies previously unused effect padding; no Unit/Creature/Player member change. Each fails its specific actual gameplay assertion with exit1; all repaired native cases exit0. This is native core counterfactual evidence, separate from the previous certificate-tool counterfactuals.",
    "retained": "Both earlier hundred-repair native suites pass, including original lethal Poison cancellation, native matching pet effects, XP/forfeit/queue ownership and other selected scopes. The latest selected100PE roots also pass. Prior source fixtures retain independently declared original views only after exact four-file lifecycle normalization; actual current native and linked behavior is separately tested. The two hundred-repair native suites and selected100PE were run on the intermediate D6 candidate; the final candidate only adds the equal-HP resurrection correction, covered by all13 native cases and current linked proof. The full immutable106-root collection is repeated on the final candidate.",
